<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling falls on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling falls on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell against the dollar and the pound, the central Bank of Tanzania said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The central bank said the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 626.1354 against Wednesday's 625.6800. Compared to the pound, it traded 1050.3453 from 1036.4990 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
